    /// std::print("{}\n",k.filter({{1},{2}}).size()); // 2
    /// ```
    ///
    /// - Parameters:
    ///   - measurements: Borrowed ordered length-m observations.
    /// - Returns: Owned actual causal mean/covariance at every completed step.
    /// - Throws: ``NativeError`` of kind `.invalidArgument` (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): On a measurement dimension mismatch.; ``NativeError`` of kind `.native` (C++ `std::runtime_error`): On underlying LU failure.; ``NativeError`` of kind `.allocation` (C++ `std::bad_alloc`): On temporary/output allocation failure.
