///   - groupSizes: At least two positive sizes summing exactly to values.size(); N must exceed the group count.
/// - Returns: statistic=F, parameter1=k-1, parameter2=N-k and upper-tail p_value; no CI or group estimates.
/// - Throws: ``NativeError`` of kind `.invalidArgument` (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): Invalid grouping/nonfinite input, no residual df, zero within- group variation or arithmetic overflow.
